        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "I finally think it might be helping, oh, oh",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I confess, I'm not that versatile",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Say I'm good, but I might be in denial",
          "persona_id": "persona_tatiana"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Takes one call and that undoes the dial (Ah)",
